## 🐛 Bug Fixes (from original code)
| Bug | Fix Applied |
|-----|-------------|
| **No sound** | Replaced `new Audio('assets/sounds/bounce.mp3')` (missing files) with **Web Audio API** — all sounds are procedurally generated in-browser, no audio assets needed |
| Fragmented multi-file structure | Merged `index.html`, `style.css`, `script.js`, `js/game.js`, `js/object.js`, `js/effects.js`, `js/sound.js` into one portable file |
| `gameStarted` gate missing on some input paths | Input events now fully gated behind `gameStarted` flag |
| Drag velocity was incorrect | Fixed drag velocity calculation using delta from new position |
| Missing AudioContext unlock | `getAudioCtx()` called on first user gesture to satisfy browser autoplay policy |

