## ✨ New Features Added

### 🏠 Landing Page
- Animated floating crayon doodles background
- Three big buttons: **Level Mode**, **Free Mode**, **How to Play**
- Smooth fade-in/out transition to game

### 🧩 Level Mode (10 Levels)
Each level has a unique goal and increasing difficulty:
| # | Name | Goal Type |
|---|------|-----------|
| 1 | Ramp It Up! | Fill zone |
| 2 | Star Collector | Collect 3 stars |
| 3 | Safe Landing | Land on pad |
| 4 | Domino Effect | Topple dominoes |
| 5 | Bridge Builder | Cross the gap |
| 6 | Star Cascade | Collect 5 stars |
| 7 | Zero Gravity?! | Navigate without gravity |
| 8 | Goo Madness! | Fill with goo |
| 9 | Rube Goldberg | Chain reactions |
| 10 | Multi-Ball Madness | Guide 3 balls |

- **Level Select Screen** — visual grid with locked/unlocked states
- **Star rating** — 1–3 stars based on how few drawings you used
- **Progressive unlock** — complete a level to unlock the next
- **Win screen** with Next Level and Back to Menu buttons

### 🎨 Free Mode
- Fully open sandbox — no goals, no limits
- Gravity toggle, save/load system (5 slots via localStorage)
- Pre-spawned objects to welcome you to the canvas

### 🔊 Procedural Sound Effects
All sounds generated via Web Audio API — no files needed:
- **Bounce** — sine wave with frequency drop on collision
- **Draw** — subtle sawtooth scratch sound while drawing
- **Star collect** — three-note ascending chime
- **Bomb** — filtered noise burst
- **Win** — ascending 6-note fanfare
- **Freeze** — rising triangle wave
- **Erase** — descending sawtooth

Toggle sound with the 🔊 button (top-right in-game).

