## 🕹️ How to Play

### Drawing
- **✏️ Draw** — click and drag on the canvas to draw crayon lines
- Lines become solid physics objects that balls and boxes collide with
- **Colors** — pick from the palette in the top bar
- **Thickness** — use the slider to adjust line width

### Tools
| Tool | Action |
|------|--------|
| ✏️ Draw | Freehand crayon lines |
| ✋ Drag | Click and drag any object |
| 🗑️ Erase | Click to delete objects or lines |
| ❄️ Freeze | Lock objects in place |

### Spawn Objects
Click the left sidebar buttons, then click the canvas to place:
| Object | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| ⚽ Ball | Bouncy circle |
| 📦 Box | Heavy block, stacks |
| 🐕 Dog | Roaming AI character |
| 🟢 Goo | Spring-connected blob cluster |
| 🪢 Rope | Click start, drag to endpoint |
| ⛓️ Chain | Like rope but heavier links |
| 💣 Bomb | Explodes after 2 seconds |
| ⭐ Star | Collectible (needed in levels) |

### Keyboard
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `Escape` | Close overlays / level select |

