## ⚙️ Technical Details

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **File type** | Single self-contained `.html` |
| **Dependencies** | Google Fonts (loaded from CDN, game works offline without them) |
| **Physics engine** | Custom impulse-based physics (no external lib) |
| **Substeps** | 3 (smooth simulation) |
| **Constraint solver** | 4 iterations per frame |
| **Max objects** | 200 (auto-culls offscreen) |
| **Target FPS** | 60 (displayed in HUD) |
| **Sound** | Web Audio API — no external files |

### Physics Features
- Rigid body circle + box collision with impulse resolution
- Angular velocity and rotation
- Gravity toggle per level
- Rope/chain constraints with sag rendering
- Spring constraints (Goo blobs)
- Bomb blast radius with force application
- Drawn shapes as collision geometry (line segments)
- Particle system for effects

